oding="async" width="1200" height="1200" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 28px, (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 28px, (max-width: 809.98px) 40px" srcset="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/cFl24iPInxckRrL32eRgadp9ZJM_2d34122f48.png 512w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/cFl24iPInxckRrL32eRgadp9ZJM_106753e122.png 1024w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/cFl24iPInxckRrL32eRgadp9ZJM_ba083b962a.png 1200w" src="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/cFl24iPInxckRrL32eRgadp9ZJM_ba083b962a.png" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div><div class="framer-p4vx9p"><div class="framer-1v6160y" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-404da5a0-b6b9-407a-b3f1-b45132783493, rgb(17, 17, 17));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1iedl9x" data-styles-preset="AM_KJg41b" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-404da5a0-b6b9-407a-b3f1-b45132783493, rgb(17, 17, 17)))">Emily Foster</p></div><div class="framer-d81nb7" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1iedl9x" data-styles-preset="AM_KJg41b">Head of Product at VeroBank</p></div></div></div><div class="framer-1efo0xu" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-404da5a0-b6b9-407a-b3f1-b45132783493, rgb(17, 17, 17));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1iedl9x" data-styles-preset="AM_KJg41b" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-404da5a0-b6b9-407a-b3f1-b45132783493, rgb(17, 17, 17)))">"Michael doesn’t just design; he solves problems. His strategic approach and design thinking helped us create an intuitive, high-performing fintech platform."</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-juoxp7" data-framer-appear-id="juoxp7" data-framer-name="Image Container" style="opacity:0.001;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-1fcsdga"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="673" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) calc(min(max(100vw, 1px), 1120px) * 0.6), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) calc(min(max(100vw, 1px), 1120px) - 80px), (max-width: 809.98px) calc(100vw - 40px)" srcset="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/h0cFvvylMOp5Xq0FrEVpT3TfZa4_ef27b298ff.jpg 512w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/h0cFvvylMOp5Xq0FrEVpT3TfZa4_46bf7a243a.jpg 1024w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/h0cFvvylMOp5Xq0FrEVpT3TfZa4_14da8e5d0a.jpg 1200w" src="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/h0cFvvylMOp5Xq0FrEVpT3TfZa4_14da8e5d0a.jpg" alt="Michael Carter craft strategic design" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><section class="framer-1wez6jx" data-framer-name="About"><div class="framer-1168klj" data-framer-name="Container"><div class="framer-wxmyqa" data-framer-name="Headline"><div class="framer-rbx4pl" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hann4s" data-styles-preset="ZUlbtNGkI" style="--framer-text-color:var(--token-923661f6-bb67-400f-9b15-4dbe77975e9c, rgb(113, 118, 127))">About Me</p></div><div class="framer-1k9z8lc" data-framer-name="Content"><div class="framer-f40ykc" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><h2 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-8kwqzc" data-styles-preset="APT599laW">I create strategic and visually compelling digital experiences that balance function and aesthetics</h2></div><div class="framer-1n8beyd" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-wz1c9z" data-styles-preset="lZAQuSrwp" style="--framer-text-color:var(--token-923661f6-bb67-400f-9b15-4dbe77975e9c, rgb(113, 118, 127))">As a digital product designer, my focus is on creating intuitive user interfaces, seamless interactions, and cohesive brand identities that drive engagement and enhance usability. Whether it’s designing SaaS dashboards, mobile apps, or high-performance websites, my approach combines creativity with a deep understanding of user needs and business goals</p></div><div class="framer-1wf01l6" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-wz1c9z" data-styles-preset="lZAQuSrwp" style="--framer-text-color:var(--token-923661f6-bb67-400f-9b15-4dbe77975e9c, rgb(113, 118, 127))">Over the years, I’ve collaborated with startups, established companies, and entrepreneurs to bring their ideas to life through thoughtful design solutions. I believe that great design goes beyond aesthetics—it solves problems, simplifies complexity, and delivers meaningful experiences. From concept to final execution, I ensure every project is strategically crafted to leave a lasting impact</p></div></div></div><div class="framer-j4we60" data-framer-name="Images"><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-sd407j"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="904" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) calc(min(max(100vw, 1px), 1120px) * 0.6), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) calc((min(max(100vw, 1px), 1120px) - 80px) * 0.6), (max-width: 809.98px) calc(min(100vw, 1120px) - 40px)" srcset="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/Gcg7JDGYYMLNKZYijGkpX4HwhXo_6495027646.webp 512w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/Gcg7JDGYYMLNKZYijGkpX4HwhXo_138dd025d0.webp 1024w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/Gcg7JDGYYMLNKZYijGkpX4HwhXo_004c1cf722.webp 1200w" src="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/Gcg7JDGYYMLNKZYijGkpX4HwhXo_004c1cf722.webp" alt="Michael Carter in a dark background" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-1g35wqs"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="800" height="1200" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) max(min(max(100vw, 1px), 1120px) * 0.4 - 12px, 1px), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max((min(max(100vw, 1px), 1120px) - 80px) * 0.4 - 12px, 1px), (max-width: 809.98px) calc(min(100vw, 1120px) - 40px)" srcset="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/wUNwdGD8sFUEQidkmXKITme4qmQ_de272e5227.webp 682w,http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/wUNwdGD8sFUEQidkmXKITme4qmQ_136d8742d9.webp 800w" src="http://localhost:8766/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/wUNwdGD8sFUEQidkmXKITme4qmQ_136d8742d9.webp" alt="Michael Carter profile with a dynamic light" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="framer-1kawdvz" data-framer-name="Work Experiences"><div class="framer-1339cub" data-framer-name="Container"><div class="frame